<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley ups Great Lakes.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley ups Great Lakes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Great Lakes Chemical Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1997 earnings view to $3.80 a share from $3.75 a share and raised the 1998 view to $4.50 a share from $4.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- cited expectations for possible recapitalization and improved fundamentals.</p>
<p>-- Great Lakes gained 1-3/4 to 48-5/8.</p>
</text>
